COSMOS GEN-CONVOY Stage 1 (docs/COSMOS-GEN-CONVOY-DESIGN.md §4.B) — per-gen-task alloc-diet, byte-off.

Build-#1 levers (lever 2, the VoxelBuffer object recycler, is HELD for Build #2 pending the §6 probe's
verdict — see design §5 S1/S3). All runtime-gated via the cosmos setup(config) dict (forwarded from
CubeSphere.FP_GEN_* consts), default off/0 => byte-identical to the current engine:
  * lever 1 (gen_profs_tls): thread_local reuse of the generator's per-column `profs` scratch vector,
    removing census site b1 (1 malloc + 1 free/block) off the global dlmalloc lock the workers convoy on.
  * lever 3 (gen_pool_prewarm): one-time VoxelMemoryPool pre-warm of the 8 KiB TYPE channel class at setup
    so the first ground crossing does not spill channel allocs to dlmalloc mid-spike (census a3).
  * §6 probe enable: forwards gen_alloc_probe to the weak core probe switch (no-op if not compiled in).
Applies on top of godot_voxel patch 0014.
